#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:1
msgid "Configuring the tablet in Krita."
msgstr "Prilagajanje tablice v Kriti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:12
#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:21
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablica"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:12
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:12
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:12
msgid "Pressure Curve"
msgstr "Krivulja pritiska"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:17
msgid "Tablet Settings"
msgstr "Nastavitve tablice"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:20
msgid ".. image:: images/preferences/Krita_Preferences_Tablet_Settings.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/preferences/Krita_Preferences_Tablet_Settings.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Input Pressure Global Curve : This is the global curve setting that your "
"tablet will use in Krita. The settings here will make your tablet feel soft "
"or hard globally."
msgstr ""
"Globalna krivulja vhodnega tlaka : To je nastavitev globalne krivulja, ki jo "
"bo vaš tablični računalnik uporabljal v Kriti. Zaradi nastavitev se bo vaš "
"tablični računalnik počutil mehak ali trd po vsem svetu."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:24
msgid ""
"Some tablet devices don't tell us whether the side buttons on a stylus. If "
"you have such a device, you can try activate this workaround. Krita will try "
"to read right and middle-button clicks as if they were coming from a mouse "
"instead of a tablet. It may or may not work on your device (depends on the "
"tablet driver implementation). After changing this option Krita should be "
"restarted."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere tablične naprave ne podajajo klikov z gumbi na pisalu. Če imate "
"takšno napravo, lahko poskusite aktivirati to nadomestno rešitev. Krita bo "
"poskušala brati klike desnega in srednjega gumba iz dogodkovnega toka miške. "
"Morda na vaši napravi deluje ali ne (odvisno od implementacije gonilnika "
"tablice). Po spremembi te možnosti je potrebno Krito znova zagnati."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:26
msgid "Use Mouse Events for Right and Middle clicks."
msgstr "Uporabite dogodke miške za desni in srednji klik."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:29
msgid ""
"This changes the way freehand brush smoothing works in Krita by using the "
"driver's timestamps instead of a timer-based one."
msgstr ""
"S tem se spremeni način glajenja prostoročnega čopiča v Kriti z uporabo "
"časovnih žigov gonilnika namesto časovnika."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:31
msgid "Use Tablet Driver Stamps For Brush Speed"
msgstr "Uporabi časovne žige gonilnika tablice za hitrost čopiča"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:34
msgid ""
"This sets what Krita should consider the maximum brush speed. You can find "
"the maximum value by using the tablet tester."
msgstr ""
"To določa, kaj naj Krita upošteva največjo hitrost čopiča. Največjo vrednost "
"lahko najdete z uporabo preizkuševalnika za grafične tablice."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:36
msgid "Maximum Brush Speed"
msgstr "Največja hitrost čopiča"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:39
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "With some devices the speed samples can be very erratic. This can be "
#| "reduced by instead of using each sample on it's own, several samples are "
#| "compared to find a smoother value. This controls how many speed samples "
#| "should be taken into account. Note that too many samples can result in "
#| "the loss of subtle speed changes."
msgid ""
"With some devices the speed samples can be very erratic. This can be reduced "
"by instead of using each sample on its own, several samples are compared to "
"find a smoother value. This controls how many speed samples should be taken "
"into account. Note that too many samples can result in the loss of subtle "
"speed changes."
msgstr ""
"Pri nekaterih napravah so hitri vzorci lahko zelo neverodostojni. To je "
"mogoče zmanjšati tako, da namesto uporabe vsakega vzorca samega zase več "
"vzorcev primerjamo, da bi našli bolj gladko vrednost. To nadzira, koliko "
"hitrih vzorcev je treba upoštevati. Upoštevajte, da lahko preveč vzorcev "
"povzroči izgubo subtilnih sprememb hitrosti."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:41
msgid "Brush Speed Smoothing"
msgstr "Hitro glajenje čopiča"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:44
msgid "On Windows 8 or above only."
msgstr "Samo v sistemih Windows 8 ali novejših."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:46
msgid "WinTab"
msgstr "WinTab"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:47
msgid ""
"Use the WinTab API to receive tablet pen input. This is the API being used "
"before Krita 3.3. This option is recommended for most Wacom tablets."
msgstr ""
"Za prejemanje vnosa peresa grafične tablice uporabite API WinTab. To je API, "
"uporabljen pred Krito 3.3. Ta možnost je priporočljiva za večino tablic "
"Wacom."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:49
msgid "For Krita 3.3 or later:Tablet Input API"
msgstr "Za Krita 3.3 ali kasnejše: API tabličnega vnosa"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:49
msgid "Windows 8+ Pointer Input"
msgstr "Vnos kazalca za Windows 8+"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:49
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Use the Pointer Input messages to receive tablet pen input. This option "
"depends on Windows Ink support from the tablet driver. This is a relatively "
"new addition so it's still considered to be experimental, but it should work "
"well enough for painting. You should try this if you are using an N-Trig "
"device (e.g. recent Microsoft Surface devices) or if your tablet does not "
"work well with WinTab."
msgstr ""
"Za prejemanje vnosa peresa za tablični računalnik uporabite sporočila za "
"vnos kazalca. Ta možnost je odvisna od podpore za Windows Ink gonilnika "
"tabličnega računalnika. To je relativno nov dodatek, tako da še vedno velja "
"za eksperimentalno, vendar bi moral delati dovolj dobro za slikanje. To "
"poskusite, če uporabljate napravo N-Trig (npr. nedavne naprave Microsoft "
"Surface) ali če tablični računalnik ne deluje dobro z winTabom."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:52
msgid "Advanced Tablet Settings for WinTab"
msgstr "Napredne nastavitve grafične tablice za WinTab"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:56
msgid ".. image:: images/preferences/advanced-settings-tablet.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/preferences/advanced-settings-tablet.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:57
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using multiple monitors or using a tablet that is also a screen, Krita "
"will get conflicting information about how big your screen is, and sometimes "
"if it has to choose itself, there will be a tablet offset. This window "
"allows you to select the appropriate screen resolution."
msgstr ""
"Pri uporabi več monitorjev ali tabličnem računalniku, ki je tudi zaslon, bo "
"Krita dobila nasprotujoče si informacije o tem, kako velik je zaslon, in "
"včasih, če se mora izbrati sam, bo tablični odmik. V tem oknu lahko izberete "
"ustrezno ločljivost zaslona."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:59
msgid "Use Information Provided by Tablet"
msgstr "Uporabi informacije, ki jih zagotavlja grafična tablica"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:60
msgid "Use the information as given by the tablet."
msgstr "Uporabi informacije, ki jih zagotavlja grafična tablica."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:61
msgid "Map to entire virtual screen"
msgstr "Preslikaj na celoten navidezni zaslon"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:62
msgid "Use the information as given by Windows."
msgstr "Uporabite informacije, kot jih nudi sistem Windows."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:64
msgid ""
"Type in the numbers manually. Use this when you have tried the other "
"options. You might even need to do trial and error if that is the case, but "
"at the least you can configure it."
msgstr ""
"Vnesite številke ročno. Uporabite to, ko ste že neuspešno poskusili z "
"drugimi možnostmi. Če je tako, boste morda morali narediti nekaj poskusov, "
"vendar lahko vsaj prilagajate to vrednost."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:66
msgid "Map to Custom Area"
msgstr "Preslikaj v področje po meri"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:66
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have a dual monitor setup and only the top half of the screen is "
"reachable, you might have to enter the total width of both screens plus the "
"double height of your monitor in this field."
msgstr ""
"Če imate nastavitev dvojnega monitorja in je dosegljiva le vrhnja polovica "
"zaslona, boste morda morali v to polje vnesti skupno širino obeh zaslonov in "
"dvojno višino monitorja."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To access this dialog in Krita versions older than 4.2, you had to do the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Za dostop do tega pogovornega okna v različicah Krita, starejših od 4.2, ste "
"morali storiti to:"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:72
msgid "Put your stylus away from the tablet."
msgstr "Postavite svoje pisalo stran od tablice."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:73
msgid ""
"Start Krita without using a stylus, that is using a mouse or a keyboard."
msgstr ""
"Zaženite Krito brez uporabe pisala, t.j. z uporabo miške ali tipkovnice."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:74
msgid "Press the :kbd:`Shift` key and hold it."
msgstr "Pritisnite :kbd:`dvigalko` in jo držite."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:75
msgid "Touch a tablet with your stylus so Krita would recognize it."
msgstr "Tablice se dotaknite s pisalom, da ga bo Krita prepoznala."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:77
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If adjusting this doesn't work, and if you have a Wacom tablet, an offset in "
"the canvas can be caused by a faulty Wacom preference file which is not "
"removed or replaced by reinstalling the drivers."
msgstr ""
"Če prilagajanje tega ne deluje in če imate tablični računalnik Wacom, lahko "
"domik na platnu povzroči napaka datoteke z nastavitvami Wacom, ki ni "
"odstranjena ali zamenjana z vnovično namestitvijo gonilnikov."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To fix it, use the “Wacom Tablet Preference File Utility” to clear all the "
"preferences. This should allow Krita to detect the correct settings "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Če jo želite popraviti, uporabite »Utility datoteke nastavitve tabličnega "
"računalnika Wacom« in počistite vse nastavitve. To naj bo kriti omogočilo "
"samodejno zaznavanje pravilnih nastavitev."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:82
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Clearing all wacom preferences will reset your tablet's configuration, thus "
"you will need to recalibrate/reconfigure it."
msgstr ""
"Če počistite vse nastavitve wacoma, ponastavite konfiguracijo tabličnega "
"računalnika, tako da jo boste morali ponovno umeriti/ponovno konfigurirati."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:85
msgid "Tablet Tester"
msgstr "Preizkuševalnik tablice"

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:89
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This is a special feature for debugging tablet input. When you click on it, "
"it will open a window with two sections. The left section is the **Drawing "
"Area** and the right is the **Text Output**."
msgstr ""
"To je posebna funkcija za odpravljanje napak pri vnosu tabličnega "
"računalnika. Ko kliknete na to, odpre okno z dvema odsekoma. Levi odsek je "
"**Območje risanje** in desno je **Izhod besedila**."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:91
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you draw over the Drawing Area, you will see a line appear. If your "
"tablet is working it should be both a red and blue line."
msgstr ""
"Če rišete nad območjem za risanje, se prikaže vrstica. Če tableta deluje, "
"mora biti rdeča in modra črta."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The red line represents mouse events. Mouse events are the most basic events "
"that Krita can pick up. However, mouse events have crude coordinates and "
"have no pressure sensitivity."
msgstr ""
"Rdeča črta predstavlja dogodke miške. Dogodki miške so najosnovnejši "
"dogodki, ki jih Krita lahko pobere. Vendar pa imajo mišji dogodki surove "
"koordinate in niso občutljivi na pritisk."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:95
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The blue line represents the tablet events. The tablet events only show up "
"when Krita can access your tablet. These have more precise coordinates and "
"access to sensors like pressure sensitivity."
msgstr ""
"Modra črta predstavlja dogodke tabličnega računalnika. Tablični dogodki se "
"prikažejo le, ko lahko krita dostopa do vašega tabličnega računalnika. Ti "
"imajo bolj natančne koordinate in dostop do senzorjev, kot je občutljivost "
"na pritisk."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:99
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you have no blue line when drawing on the lefthand drawing area, Krita "
"cannot access your tablet. Check out the :ref:`page on drawing tablets "
"<drawing_tablets>` for suggestions on what is causing this."
msgstr ""
"Če pri risanje na območju za risanje na levi strani ni modre črte, krita ne "
"more dostopati do tabličnega računalnika. Za predloge o tem, kaj to "
"povzroča, si oglejte na strani :ref:'na risanju tablet<drawing_tablets>."

#: ../../reference_manual/preferences/tablet_settings.rst:101
msgid ""
"When you draw a line, the output on the right will show all sorts of text "
"output. This text output can be attached to a help request or a bug report "
"to figure out what is going on."
msgstr ""
"Ko narišete črto, bo izhod na desni prikazal vse vrste izhoda besedila. Ta "
"izhod besedila je mogoče priložiti zahtevi za pomoč ali poročilu o napakah, "
"da ugotovite, kaj se dogaja."

